Value PEER_LSR_ID (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value LABEL_SPACE (\d+)
Value STATE (\S+(?: \S+)?)
Value ROLE (Active|Passive)

# One record per LDP peer of the public instance (vpn-fabric lab, Comware 7.1).
Start
  ^\s*VPN instance:\s+public instance\s*$$
  ^\s*Total number of peers:\s+\d+\s*$$
  ^\s*Peer LDP ID\s+State\s+Role\s+GR\s+MD5\s+KA Sent/Rcvd\s*$$
  ^\s*${PEER_LSR_ID}:${LABEL_SPACE}\s+${STATE}\s+${ROLE}\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+\d+/\d+\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized display mpls ldp peer line"
